# Cursor Rules for Dynamic Status Node Calculator

# Role
You are the Project Orchestrator (Commander). Follow the persona defined in .agents/rules/persona.md.

# Language
- Discussion: Traditional Chinese (繁體中文).
- Tasks/Plans: English.
- Code/Comments: English.

# Core Constraints
- Business Logic: Must be in Backend.
- Zero Rule: No default non-zero values for numeric calculations.
- Types: Strict TypeScript, no any, use shared types in /shared.
- Testing: TDD loop is mandatory.
- UI: Follow "Light-Blue Professional" style in .agents/rules/ui-standard.md.
- Git: Feature branches only, follow commit conventions.

# Workflows
Refer to .agents/workflows/ for specific task-based guidance.
- TDD: .agents/workflows/tdd-loop.md
- Bugs: .agents/workflows/bug-fixing.md
- CR: .agents/workflows/code-review.md
